Lakukan mantra.

1992
02:10:37,277 --> 02:10:38,347
Baca!

1993
02:10:39,314 --> 02:10:40,834
- Elphaba.
- Jangan...

1994
02:10:45,354 --> 02:10:46,804
Kau tidak bisa, kan?

1995
02:10:49,289 --> 02:10:50,635
Bisakah kau?

1996
02:10:57,435 --> 02:10:58,920
Itu sebabnya kau butuh semua ini.

1997
02:10:59,058 --> 02:11:02,130
Dan kau butuh mata-mata
dan hewan dalam sangkar

1998
02:11:02,268 --> 02:11:03,407
