1999
02:11:04,270 --> 02:11:05,858
Kau tidak punya kekuatan nyata.

2000
02:11:06,582 --> 02:11:07,583
Tepat sekali.

2001
02:11:08,481 --> 02:11:09,896
Itulah kenapa aku butuh kau.

2002
02:11:10,448 --> 02:11:13,520
Pikirkan tentang masa depanmu, sayang.

2003
02:11:14,004 --> 02:11:15,212
Jangan mendekat.

2004
02:11:17,939 --> 02:11:19,388
Elphie, dengarkan mereka.

2005
02:11:21,563 --> 02:11:22,771
Tolong.

2006
02:11:23,427 --> 02:11:24,827
Nasihat yang baik, nona muda.

2007
02:11:24,946 --> 02:11:28,915
Dengarkan, Elphaba,
jika kau bisa melakukan ini,

2008
02:11:29,053 --> 02:11:31,055
