Bawa dia kembali.

2021
02:12:04,468 --> 02:12:06,746
Elphie. Elphie!

2022
02:12:12,994 --> 02:12:14,581
Dengarkan.

2023
02:12:18,447 --> 02:12:20,587
Dengarkan!

2024
02:12:22,106 --> 02:12:24,798
Jika kalian ingin menjaga
keluargamu aman,

2025
02:12:24,937 --> 02:12:27,698
